Installed by npm / pip (not bundled)
- HyperFrames (render engine) — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes
- GSAP — GreenSock Standard License — https://gsap.com/standard-license
- RapidOCR + PaddleOCR PP-OCR models — Apache-2.0
- faster-whisper — MIT; OpenAI Whisper model weights — MIT
