- dm_control (scene assembly, mjcf) — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/google-deepmind/dm_control
- Gymnasium (MuJoCo environments for learning explainers) — MIT — https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Gymnasium
- myo_sim / MyoSuite (human hand musculoskeletal model) — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/MyoHub/myo_sim
- 3D assets (engine/craft/assets3d.py): Poly Haven and ambientCG (CC0) are downloaded on request into data/ and never bundled;
